{"page":213,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"206","words":[{"text":"206","x":210,"y":143,"width":75,"height":36}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":594,"y":147,"width":124,"height":25},{"text":"03","x":729,"y":148,"width":32,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":795,"y":154,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":839,"y":147,"width":129,"height":29},{"text":"계층","x":980,"y":145,"width":50,"height":30}]},{"text":"GBN에서는 수신자의 행동도 단순하다. 만약 순서번호 ,,을 가진 패킷이 오류 없","words":[{"text":"GBN에서는","x":635,"y":274,"width":183,"height":38},{"text":"수신자의","x":832,"y":272,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"행동도","x":981,"y":272,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"단순하다.","x":1093,"y":270,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"만약","x":1252,"y":270,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"순서번호","x":1335,"y":269,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":",,을","x":1485,"y":269,"width":54,"height":37},{"text":"가진","x":1555,"y":269,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"패킷이","x":1641,"y":270,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"오류","x":1761,"y":273,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"없","x":1843,"y":279,"width":26,"height":37}]},{"text":"이 그리고 순서대로 수신된다면(즉, 상위 계층에 마지막으로 전달된 데이터가 순서번","words":[{"text":"이","x":571,"y":333,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"그리고","x":618,"y":333,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"순서대로","x":734,"y":333,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"수신된다면(즉,","x":881,"y":331,"width":219,"height":39},{"text":"상위","x":1117,"y":330,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"계층에","x":1201,"y":331,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"마지막으로","x":1315,"y":330,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"전달된","x":1503,"y":329,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"데이터가","x":1621,"y":330,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"순서번","x":1776,"y":331,"width":91,"height":44}]},{"text":"호n - 1을 가진 패킷에서 온 것이라면), 수신지는 패킷 ,,에 대한 ACK를 송신하고 상","words":[{"text":"호n","x":569,"y":394,"width":62,"height":31},{"text":"-","x":648,"y":411,"width":24,"height":4},{"text":"1을","x":693,"y":393,"width":49,"height":37},{"text":"가진","x":755,"y":393,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"패킷에서","x":832,"y":391,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"온","x":975,"y":392,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"것이라면),","x":1023,"y":390,"width":151,"height":39},{"text":"수신지는","x":1188,"y":390,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"패킷","x":1338,"y":391,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":",,에","x":1416,"y":390,"width":50,"height":37},{"text":"대한","x":1483,"y":390,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"ACK를","x":1563,"y":391,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"송신하고","x":1693,"y":390,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"상","x":1839,"y":398,"width":30,"height":37}]},{"text":"위 계층에 패킷의 데이터 부분을 전달한다. 그 외의 경우에는 수신자는 그 패킷을 비리","words":[{"text":"위","x":569,"y":452,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"계층에","x":616,"y":453,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"패킷의","x":727,"y":452,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"데이터","x":839,"y":451,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"부분을","x":950,"y":451,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"전달한다.","x":1064,"y":450,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1218,"y":456,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"외의","x":1265,"y":450,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"경우에는","x":1346,"y":451,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"수신자는","x":1493,"y":451,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1645,"y":456,"width":35,"height":26},{"text":"패킷을","x":1694,"y":451,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"비리","x":1810,"y":454,"width":55,"height":42}]},{"text":"고 가장 최근에 제대로 수신된 순서의 패킷에 대한 ACK를 재전송한다. 패킷이 상위","words":[{"text":"고","x":567,"y":517,"width":33,"height":25},{"text":"가장","x":616,"y":512,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"최근에","x":699,"y":512,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"제대로","x":815,"y":512,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"수신된","x":927,"y":511,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"순서의","x":1042,"y":511,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"패킷에","x":1159,"y":511,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":1276,"y":511,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"ACK를","x":1359,"y":513,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"재전송한다.","x":1491,"y":511,"width":180,"height":39},{"text":"패킷이","x":1691,"y":512,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"상위","x":1808,"y":514,"width":57,"height":43}]},{"text":"계층에 한 번에 하나씩 전송되므로, 만일 패킷 k가 수신되고 상위 계층에 전달되었다","words":[{"text":"계층에","x":568,"y":572,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":682,"y":573,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"번에","x":731,"y":572,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"하나씩","x":811,"y":571,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"전송되므로,","x":927,"y":571,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"만일","x":1117,"y":571,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"패킷","x":1200,"y":571,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"k가","x":1280,"y":571,"width":54,"height":38},{"text":"수신되고","x":1347,"y":572,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"상위","x":1500,"y":573,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"계층에","x":1586,"y":573,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"전달되었다","x":1707,"y":573,"width":162,"height":44}]},{"text":"면, 이때는 이미 k보다 낮은 순서번호를 가진 모든 패킷 또한 전달되어 있다는 것을 유","words":[{"text":"면,","x":567,"y":632,"width":39,"height":37},{"text":"이때는","x":622,"y":632,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"이미","x":735,"y":632,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"k보다","x":811,"y":631,"width":85,"height":38},{"text":"낮은","x":909,"y":631,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"순서번호를","x":987,"y":631,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"가진","x":1168,"y":632,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":1247,"y":634,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"패킷","x":1330,"y":633,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"또한","x":1410,"y":633,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"전달되어","x":1494,"y":633,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"있다는","x":1646,"y":634,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"것을","x":1765,"y":634,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"유","x":1839,"y":640,"width":30,"height":38}]},{"text":"넘하라. 그러므로 누적 확인응답을 시용하는 것은 GBN을 위한 자연스런 선택이다.","words":[{"text":"넘하라.","x":565,"y":691,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"그러므로","x":686,"y":691,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"누적","x":831,"y":691,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"확인응답을","x":910,"y":691,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"시용하는","x":1089,"y":692,"width":136,"height":38},